<section class="sound-listening-cta">
  <div class="sound-listening-cta__container">

    <p class="sound-listening-cta__eyebrow">Mirellis Listening System</p>

    <h2 class="sound-listening-cta__headline">What are you transitioning from?</h2>

    <p class="sound-listening-cta__body">Select your state. The system finds your environment.</p>

    <div class="sound-listening-cta__grid">
      <a href="/pages/listening?transition=waking" class="sound-listening-cta__card">Waking Up</a>
      <a href="/pages/listening?transition=starting" class="sound-listening-cta__card">Starting Work</a>
      <a href="/pages/listening?transition=focus" class="sound-listening-cta__card">Deep Focus</a>
      <a href="/pages/listening?transition=ending" class="sound-listening-cta__card">Ending Work</a>
